{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57225","headline":"谶 十四 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八（《天圣广灯录》作「九」）女出人伦，（八女者，安字也。\n出人伦者，爲国师也。\n）八个绝婚姻。\n（个个者，安字。\n绝婚姻者，安徒难爲绍继之）圬床（《天圣广灯录》作「将」）添六脚，（圬床者，老字也。\n六脚者，则天、中宗，腾腾坦然圆寂，百五十五年住世，破竈堕和尚六住嵩山，是爲六脚也）心祖衆中尊。\n（心祖者，姓也。\n安和尚顿悟禅理爲国师，故衆中尊也）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}